    "slug": "adventure-travel-companies",
    "metaTitle": "Top 10 Best Adventure Travel Companies for 2026",
    "metaDescription": "There are adventure tour companies out there for every niche - from family adventures to small groups to luxury expeditions.",
    "ogImage": "https://images.top10.com/iu/c_thumb,g_auto,h_420,w_800/f_auto/q_auto/v1/production/charts/uploads/photo/Adventure%20Travel%20Companies%20Header%20Image.20200917113826.jpg",
    "heroTitle": "Top 10 Best Adventure Travel Companies",
    "name": "Adventure-travel-companies",
    "introContent": "<div><span></span><span><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">Who Is the Best Adventure Travel Company To Book With?</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">Nothing beats adventure travel, but who has time to organize it? Fortunately, you don’t need to plan every detail of your next trip, because there are countless adventure tour companies that can do it for you. </p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">The global adventure travel market has boomed in recent years, reaching a value of $586 billion in 2018. </p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">To help you plan your next trip, we compiled the following list of the 10 best adventure travel companies. The list begins with the best travel companies overall and ends with the best travel companies for segments of the population such as families, young people, and seniors.</p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">1. G Adventures - Best Adventure Travel Company Overall</h2></span><span><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gadventures.com%2Fdestinations%2F&amp;rank=1&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6Im5Ua3hObENuK29tY2FHUU9KM2pNYTAzKzBPVT0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0.0LWrhx4LFOrMxTdQ8HNxr6SzlBhab8u2r7H68tqX6Fo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">G Adventures</a> was founded in 1990 by Bruce Poon Tip, who wanted an alternative to big tours and backpack trips. Today, G Adventures is one of the biggest adventure tour companies on the planet, with hundreds of tour options at any given time. G Adventures is well-known for its unique themes, such as ‘Local Living’ tours and the Jane Goodall Collection, wildlife adventure trips endorsed by the legendary primatologist herself.</p></span><span><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>Local Living Italy-Tuscany San Gimignano. 7-day deep dive into the towns, vineyards, and countryside of central Tuscany, through the eyes of locals.</p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">2. Intrepid Travel – Best Adventure Travel Company for Small Groups</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.intrepidtravel.com%2Fil&amp;rank=2&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6IjJjVGVqMVRJR0V2RHUrRlVaNVRRaUhiK2lJUT0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0.ISMGervloeQFWXcJh8zuyJiXLOYrK5x3Cq2FAHKNG-c\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">Intrepid Travel</a> is another of the pioneers in adventure travel. Founded in Australia in 1989, it is now the largest small group adventure tour company in the world. It is also the largest travel company to be certified as a B Corporation – a certification for businesses that balance profit with ethical behavior. Whatever your preference – family trip, under 30s group, vegan food tours – Intrepid travel has adventures for every niche. </p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>Mexico Unplugged Lonely Planet Experience. 15-days of exploring the heart of southern Mexico’s Aztec, Zapotec, Maya, and Spanish cultures.</p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">3. National Geographic Expeditions - Best for Unique Expeditions Led by Nat Geo Expert Guides</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">The <a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nationalgeographic.com%2Fexpeditions%2F&amp;rank=3&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6InIyVnBrWEVseGZ0bHRnSUhmSlRVS3hJek9GRT0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0.-E8HeAMQigt7DEZV0O-NEAXCeBxMvb3yQF1gV5IVhe0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">National Geographic</a> brand needs no introduction, although it’s less-known that Nat Geo offers world-class adventure tours for regular travelers. When you travel with National Geographic Expeditions, you get a unique expedition curated by National Geographic and led by Nat Geo’s own expert geographers, educators, filmmakers, anthropologists, and ecologists. Adventure travel doesn’t come any more professional than this.</p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>Epic Patagonia. 20-day expedition tracing the Chilean Coast aboard the National Geographic Explorer, a state-of-the-art, ice-class expedition ship. </p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">4. Austin Adventures - Best for Private &amp; Custom Adventure Tours</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">Founded in the mid-80s, <a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.austinadventures.com%2F&amp;rank=4&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6IlRhbEJMSk0yL0NzSTJ4QVJFS2JnNVBhdHhEND0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0.0vPXLDFQc1BpZlNkAoUuipQJ733H7Jn5dhXsYVG-Mng\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">Austin Adventures</a> is a family-owned company focused on high-end and custom expeditions. Every Austin trip has carefully placed ‘wow’ moments built in, like your guide popping around a bend in the trail with a pineapple carved like a fish on a silver platter. The other thing you’ll notice from reading some of the itineraries is how much attention is paid to selecting the <script data-testid=\"ui-event-script-tag\" data-ui-event-type=\"click\" data-ui-event-category=\"WYSIWYG\" data-ui-event-action=\"Click on an internal link\" data-ui-event-label=\"Redirect to /hotel-booking-sites\" data-ui-event-non-interaction=\"false\"></script><a data-testid=\"wysiwyg-internal-link\" href=\"/hotel-booking-sites\" target=\"_self\" data-link-media-type=\"url\" data-link-type=\"internal\" data-page-type-id=\"5c1231afdb2f4e91c6ab4a84\" data-page-type-name=\"chart\" data-role-id=\"content-link\" data-segment-id=\"5b0fd4294bcb675a59845463\" data-site-id=\"5a8007577dce0a00014ed216\" data-vertical-id=\"5b0fd4295823c3552265f68d\" class=\"e13n9rjo0 ni-1fxr0i0 elzjmzq0\">best hotels</a>, lodges, and haciendas.</p></span><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>Indonesia – Bali Seatrek. 7-day adventure on Bali and neighboring islands, taking in remote beaches, coastal villages, volcanoes, waterfalls, and Komodo dragons.</p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">5. Abercrombie &amp; Kent - Best for Luxury Travel Adventures</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">The <a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.abercrombiekent.com%2F&amp;rank=5&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6Im9vNjNiU1VjdmJ2RVBWWlZKVFRGWHl0cmg5Yz0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0.FX4ORBejfnFiIhPj75k8yzGg4BR9iKfRP5pif-yq808\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">Abercrombie &amp; Kent</a> story began on the plains of Africa in 1962 when Geoffrey Kent and his parents began offering a new style of luxury adventure safaris. Today, A&amp;K has luxury adventure tours all around the globe, offering incredible wildlife and wilderness with luxury accommodation and concierge service. </p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>Signature Great Migration Safari. 6-night tailor-made journey for small groups, taking in the Serengeti, Masai Mara, and nights in luxury safari lodges.</p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">6. Thomson Family Adventures - Best Adventure Travel Company for Families</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">As the name suggests, <a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Ffamilyadventures.com%2F&amp;rank=6&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6Imo2NUw3OW1JMGEvMDlEUkN6TlIrd3plVEJoTT0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0._mZRhsTTTH6LkPjeHXE_z1BiUTAKaBtcQKQ3PcF1kus\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">Thomson</a> offers worldwide travel adventures designed for families. Thomson’s ‘adventure artisans’ curate every trip to include activities enjoyable to adults and kids (like hot air balloons!). The best thing about Thomson is it can accommodate all types of groups – from multi-generation trips to solo parents to families with teenagers. It can even accommodate large family reunions.</p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>Baja Multi-Sport Adventure. 7-day adventure in Baja California, incorporating activities like surfing, swimming with whale sharks, and snorkelling in the Sea of Cortez.</p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">7. REI Adventures – Best Adventure Travel Company for Millennials</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">REI Co-op is one of the best-known companies for travel and outdoor gear. <a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fadventures&amp;rank=7&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6IjExMnJ5Umh4eWNhRjY4ZkJrQzVkSUU3U25uYz0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0.ERuj_nvmUJ-n-lEP-EZBq1g1FV98CJ2VwLl6cPyF85o\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">REI Adventures</a> is its niche adventure travel division. The focus here is specialty trips, including under-35s, women’s adventures, family adventures, volunteering vacations, and weekend trips. Not surprisingly for a giant of the outdoors, REI Adventures can build tours around every activity imaginable – including backpacking, mountain biking, kayaking, and snowshoeing.</p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>Yosemite Backpacking – The High Country. 4 days of intense backpacking through the less-explored parts of Yosemite National Park.</p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">8. ElderTreks - Best Adventure Tour Company for Travelers Aged 50+</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">While other adventure travel organizations have trips for older people, <a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eldertreks.com%2F&amp;rank=8&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6Im92ZDJHc3IzdXpPSkpBWHlBanQ4OEVpSVV4ST0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0.xamAEaYmMBiDlrnNK13AooQvZWYdf8yKdio3LZUTYfQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">ElderTreks</a> is one of the only companies solely dedicated to the 50+ crowd. ElderTreks offers a range of exotic adventure tours by land and sea in more than 100 countries. Its specialty is polar tours in Greenland, Canada, and the Arctic.</p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>High Arctic Explorer. 12-day trip through Greenland, Nunavut, and the Arctic Sea, taking in fjords, belugas and more from the comfort of the Ocean Endeavour.</p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">9. AdventureWomen – Best Adventure Travel Company for Women</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.adventurewomen.com%2F&amp;rank=9&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6IlhITzJjNmdXL0lvamQ2WjZ3TVhnRWQ3eklUcz0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0.7XvdvcA5i_ovoTZYCAeqmnVvjJrLZWg3_2STAqdGd8M\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">AdventureWomen</a> is a women-owned-and-operated adventure tour company founded in 1982. It now offers dozens of women-only tours in more than 60 countries around the world. Its mission is to help women physically and mentally challenge themselves while exploring the world at their own pace and on their own terms. Although AdventureWomen’s audience tends towards 50+, it also has tours designed for 20-50-year-olds.</p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>Morocco: Sahara Sands, Markets, and a Feast for the Senses. 14-day cultural journey exploring Morocco’s culture, mountain villages, local markets, and amazing cuisine.</p><h2 data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-14l1ewd e1el6ncd4\">10. Urban Adventures – Best Travel Experiences for Foodies</h2><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\">Owned by Intrepid Travel, <a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"/v?product_id=10289&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.urbanadventures.com%2F&amp;rank=10&amp;bi=%7B%22blrs%22%3A53029%2C%22utm_source%22%3A%22Direct%22%7D&amp;uid=7lDP7mrfi6Mt7M0544kc&amp;riid=UJv8qMT55WOnVL0544kc&amp;tkn=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0eXBlIjoiY21zIiwidmVyc2lvbiI6MSwiaGFzaCI6ImI1VWg0K0RQamhiSXhSaFFqak8vWER5WjZzUT0iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzAwOTU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc3MDE4MTg1OX0.uPUnywjF2m_yqVApxrNMTVOhN0pcaf-tZzMYYd93BTs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"nilink ni-wghrws elzjmzq0\">Urban Adventures</a> is an adventure tour company focused purely on city experiences like eating, drinking, and shopping. In contrast to the other companies on our list, Urban Adventures doesn’t offer end-to-end tours. Rather, it offers short (mainly 1-day or half-day) experiences in cities around the world. Next time you’re travelling abroad, you can search Urban Adventures for local cooking, eating, and drinking experiences.</p><p data-testid=\"wysiwyg-typography\" class=\"ni-mczmtn e1el6ncd2\"><strong>Our favorite trip: </strong>Online Private Delhi Experience. Built for the new age of travel restrictions, this experience brings you an authentic vegetarian Indian cooking class straight to your home.</p></div>"
  },
